ldren":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" ends up as after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" runs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefinedInitialQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryFnData, TQueryKey> & WithDefinedInitialData<TQueryFnData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts:187](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L187)\n\nThe options accepted by the `queryOptions` overload selected when `initialData` is set — `data` is never\n`undefined` (unless a `select` changes `TData` to include `undefined`).\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefinedInitialQueryOptions\ntitle: DefinedInitialQueryOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefinedInitialQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryFnData, TQueryKey> & WithDefinedInitialData<TQueryFnData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts:187](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L187)\n\nThe options accepted by the `queryOptions` overload selected when `initialData` is set — `data` is never\n`undefined` (unless a `select` changes `TData` to include `undefined`).\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n"}
